  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Vali-Validation. Targets net7.0/net8.0/net9.0/net10.0. Provides:\n      - ValiValidationMiddleware: catches ValidationException and returns HTTP 400 problem+json.\n      - ValiValidationFilter<T>: Minimal API endpoint filter for automatic request validation.\n      - ValiValidateAttribute: MVC action filter for automatic controller action validation.\n      - UseValiValidationExceptionHandler() and WithValiValidation<T>() extension methods.",
