  "published": "2026-09-29T02:22:55.927Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0\n      - Adds net10.0 to the multi-targeted frameworks (now net7.0/net8.0/net9.0/net10.0).\n      - Now depends on Vali-Validation 3.0.0+, which brings Severity-aware ValidationResult,\n        RuleSets, block-level When/Unless, InjectValidator, Localization (English/Spanish built in),\n        ValiValidationOptions.Global, and PropertyValidator to any validator used through this\n        package's middleware/filter/attribute. No changes to this package's own public API.\n\n      v1.0.0 — Initial release.\n      - ValiValidationMiddleware catches ValidationException, returns RFC 7807 problem+json.\n      - ValiValidationFilter<T> (IEndpointFilter) for Minimal API endpoint validation.\n      - ValiValidateAttribute (IAsyncActionFilter) for MVC controller action validation.\n      - UseValiValidationExceptionHandler() middleware registration.\n      - WithValiValidation<T>() fluent extension for Minimal API routes.\n      - AddValiValidationProblemDetails() DI helper.",
